# ==================================================
# ARGUS — INTERNAL AND SENSITIVE DOCUMENTATION
# ==================================================
# See docs/SECURITY_AND_DOCUMENT_HANDLING.md for the full policy.
# The repository stays public; only the paths below are excluded. A
# `public/` subfolder inside any ignored directory is the escape hatch for
# a future sanitized version of that material.

# Foundational doctrine documents (Filosofía, Doctrina, Modelo de Dominio,
# Diccionario) — internal by default. Everything in this folder is ignored
# except a sanitized README explaining where the real files live.
docs/files/*
!docs/files/README.md

# Internal architecture docs (canonical/incident design, engine and
# data-model implementation detail, migration plans) plus the private/
# convention for new sensitive architecture material, including the
# foundational Data Architecture v1.0 / v1.1 documents.
docs/architecture/
!docs/architecture/public/
!docs/architecture/public/**

# Internal/highly-sensitive audits (P0/P1 findings, endpoint matrices,
# system maps, technical debt, RLS gaps — never for public repos)
docs/audit/
docs/audits/
docs/final-audit/
!docs/audit/public/
!docs/audit/public/**
!docs/audits/public/
!docs/audits/public/**
!docs/final-audit/public/
!docs/final-audit/public/**

# Security architecture, permissions model, rate limiting, seed safety
docs/security/
!docs/security/public/
!docs/security/public/**

# Internal/tactical operational documentation (runbooks, SLOs,
# observability, telemetry dictionary, source activation backlog)
docs/operations/
!docs/operations/public/
!docs/operations/public/**

# Internal mobile app and module architecture/specs
docs/mobile/
docs/modules/

# Internal product status/roadmap material
docs/product/

# Internal maintenance and technical-debt tracking
docs/maintenance/

# Internal testing baseline (documents P0 security-fix coverage)
docs/testing/

# Generic internal/private catch-alls
docs/internal/
docs/private/
docs/database/private/
docs/migrations/private/
docs/strategy/private/

# Legal drafts (moved out of the tracked docs/legal/ root)
docs/legal/private/

# Individual internal/highly-sensitive documents that live directly under
# docs/ root alongside legitimate public docs (PUBLIC_CHANGELOG.md,
# ARGUS_USER_GUIDE.md, SECURITY_AND_DOCUMENT_HANDLING.md stay tracked).
# Auth, identity, access-control and privacy/RLS implementation detail:
docs/ARGUS_AUTH.md
docs/ARGUS_AUTH_GATE_AND_IDENTITY.md
docs/ARGUS_CONSENT_MODEL.md
docs/ARGUS_DATA_RIGHTS_PLAN.md
